Perfect! I can see the project structure. To make your CV Builder installable on Android and iPhone devices, you need to add PWA (Progressive Web App) capabilities. Here's what needs to be done:

## 📱 Making Your CV Builder Installable as a PWA

### **What Needs to Be Added:**

#### **1. Web App Manifest** (`public/manifest.json`)
```json
{
  "name": "CV Builder - Professional Resume Creator",
  "short_name": "CV Builder",
  "description": "Create professional resumes with beautiful templates",
  "start_url": "/",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#ffffff",
  "theme_color": "#2563eb",
  "orientation": "portrait-primary",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "/icon-72x72.png",
      "sizes": "72x72",
      "type": "image/png",
      "purpose": "any maskable"
    },
    {
      "src": "/icon-96x96.png",
      "sizes": "96x96",
      "type": "image/png",
      "purpose": "any maskable"
    },
    {
      "src": "/icon-128x128.png",
      "sizes": "128x128",
      "type": "image/png",
      "purpose": "any maskable"
    },
    {
      "src": "/icon-144x144.png",
      "sizes": "144x144",
